<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns Aaa to Tokyo Elec Y100 bln bonds.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Aaa to Tokyo Elec Y100 bln bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Thursday that it had assigned its Aaa rating to Tokyo Electric Power Co Inc's 100 billion yen 2.5 percent domestic bonds due 2007.</p>
<p>The rating is based on the company's importance to the national economy and its very favourable industry operating environment, Moody's said in a statement.</p>
</text>
